<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney upgraded Safeway Inc to buy from outperform, the office of analyst Gary Giblen confirmed.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 12-month price target to $60 from $48.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Safeway posted higher second quarter earnings profits despite one-time charges for labor disputes and early retirement of debt.  The retailer earned $0.52 a share compared with $0.44 a share last year.</p>
<p>-- Safeway gained 2-3/8 to 52-5/8.</p>
</text>
